Dependencies beyond base, bytestring, containers and the one
cryptography library, and what needs each.

    crypton      the cryptography library: SHA-256, Ed25519, X25519,
                 AES-256-CBC, HMAC-SHA-256

    memory       crypton hands back digests and keys as ByteArray, and
                 Data.ByteArray.convert is the way to a ByteString.
                 The harness reads and writes hex through
                 Data.ByteArray.Encoding.
